#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/cross-site-requests.rst:12
msgid ""
"Except for the sustainability API, all of the above endpoints don't allow "
"you to pass credentials in cross-site requests. In other words, these API "
"endpoints allow you to access **public information only**."
msgstr "除 sustainability API 外，上述所有端点都不允许在跨站请求中传递凭据。换言之，这些 API 端点仅允许访问**公开信息** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/cross-site-requests.rst:16
msgid ""
"On a technical level, this is achieved by implementing the CORS_ standard, "
"which is supported by all major browsers. We implement it such way that it "
"strictly match the intention of the API endpoint."
msgstr "技术上，这是通过实现 CORS_ 标准实现的，所有主流浏览器均支持。我们的实现方式严格匹配 API 端点的意图。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/cross-site-requests.rst:23
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Cookie"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/cross-site-requests.rst:25
msgid ""
"On |org_brand|, our session cookies have the ``SameSite`` attribute set to "
"``Lax``, This means that browsers will not include them in cross site "
"requests. All resources in |org_brand| are public, you don't need to pass "
"cookies to make use of our allowed APIs from other sites."
msgstr ""
"在 |org_brand| 上，我们的会话 cookie 将 ``SameSite`` 属性设为 ``Lax`` "
"，这意味着浏览器不会在跨站请求中携带它们。|org_brand| 上的所有资源均为公开，你无需传递 cookie 即可从其他站点使用我们允许的 API。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/cross-site-requests.rst:30
msgid ""
"On |com_brand|, our session cookies have the ``SameSite`` attribute set to "
"``Lax``, this means that browsers will not include them in cross site "
"requests. If you need to have access to versions that the current user has "
"permissions over, you can make use of our proxied APIs, they can be accessed"
" from docs domains with the `/_/` prefix. For example, you can make use of "
"our search API from `<your-docs-domain>/_/api/v2/search/`."
msgstr ""
"在 |com_brand| 上，我们的会话 cookie 将 ``SameSite`` 属性设为 ``Lax`` "
"，这意味着浏览器不会在跨站请求中携带它们。如果你需要访问当前用户有权限的版本，可以使用我们的代理 API，它们可通过文档域名的 `/_/` "
"前缀访问。例如，你可以从 `<your-docs-domain>/_/api/v2/search/` 使用我们的搜索 API。"

